        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>中国古典家具图文分析⑦ 玫瑰椅图文分析</title>\n<script src=\"https://polyfill.io/v3/polyfill.min.js?features=es6\"></script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  body{\n    margin:0;\n    background:#efe9dd;\n    font-family:\"Songti SC\",\"SimSun\",\"STSong\",serif;\n    color:#1a1a1a;\n  }\n  .page{\n    position:relative;\n    width:540px;\n    height:729px;\n    margin:0 auto;\n    background:#f0eade;\n    background-image:linear-gradient(115deg, rgba(0,0,0,0.03) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0.05) 40%, rgba(0,0,0,0.04) 100%);\n    overflow:hidden;\n    box-sizing:border-box;\n  }\n  /* top bar */\n  .topbar{\n    position:absolute;\n    top:8px;left:0;right:0;\n    height:34px;\n    display:flex;\n    align-items:center;\n    padding-left:8px;\n    font-size:15px;\n  }\n  .from{\n    font-family:Georgia,\"Times New Roman\",serif;\n    font-style:italic;\n    font-weight:bold;\n    font-size:19px;\n    margin-right:4px;\n  }\n  .logo-circle{\n    width:28px;height:28px;\n    border-radius:50%;\n    background:#c8102e;\n    display:inline-block;\n    margin-right:5px;\n    position:relative;\n    overflow:hidden;\n  }\n  .logo-circle::after{\n    content:\"\";\n    position:absolute;\n    left:6px;top:5px;\n    width:16px;height:18px;\n    background:#f3ece0;\n    border-radius:50% 50% 45% 45%;\n  }\n  .topbar .t1{font-size:15px;letter-spacing:0.5px;}\n  .xhs{\n    display:inline-block;\n    background:#ff2442;\n    color:#fff;\n    font-size:14px;\n    font-weight:bold;\n    padding:1px 6px;\n    border-radius:3px;\n    margin:0 3px;\n    line-height:1.15;\n  }\n  .xhs small{\n    display:block;\n    font-size:5px;\n    font-weight:normal;\n    letter-spacing:0.5px;\n  }\n  .topbar .t2{\n    font-size:17px;\n    font-weight:bold;\n    margin-left:6px;\n  }\n  .rule{\n    position:absolute;\n    top:44px;left:8px;right:8px;\n    border-top:1px solid #333;\n  }\n\n  /* Title */\n  .title{\n    position:absolute;\n    top:52px;\n    right:14px;\n    text-align:right;\n    line-height:1;\n  }\n  .title .main{\n    font-size:47px;\n    font-weight:bold;\n    letter-spacing:2px;\n    font-family:\"Heiti SC\",\"SimHei\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;\n  }\n  .title .sub{\n    font-size:31px;\n    font-weight:bold;\n    margin-top:6px;\n    letter-spacing:2px;\n    font-family:\"Songti SC\",\"SimSun\",serif;\n  }\n\n  /* text blocks */\n  .tb{\n    position:absolute;\n    font-size:11.5px;\n    line-height:1.55;\n    text-align:justify;\n    letter-spacing:0.3px;\n  }\n  .block-tl{ top:88px; left:20px; width:150px; }\n  .block-ml{ top:318px; left:14px; width:120px; }\n  .block-mr{ top:355px; right:14px; width:118px; }\n  .block-bottom{\n    position:absolute;\n    left:16px; right:16px;\n    top:552px;\n    font-size:11.5px;\n    line-height:1.62;\n    text-align:justify;\n  }\n  .source{\n    position:absolute;\n    bottom:8px;\n    left:0;right:0;\n    text-align:center;\n    font-size:10.5px;\n  }\n  .botrule{\n    position:absolute;\n    bottom:26px;left:8px;right:8px;\n    border-top:1px solid #333;\n  }\n\n  /* labels */\n  .label{\n    position:absolute;\n    font-size:13px;\n    font-weight:bold;\n    letter-spacing:1px;\n    font-family:\"Heiti SC\",\"SimHei\",sans-serif;\n  }\n  .lb-beibei{ top:66px; left:150px; }      /* 椅背 */\n  .lb-touhua{ top:140px; left:243px; }     /* 透雕花饰 */\n  .lb-bitou{ top:186px; left:415px; }      /* 鼻头榫 */\n  .lb-kazi{  top:285px; left:76px; }       /* 卡子花 */\n  .lb-hengcheng{ top:288px; left:415px; }  /* 横枨 */\n  .lb-tuizu-r{ top:487px; left:415px; }    /* 腿足 右 */\n  .lb-tuizu-l{ top:515px; left:76px; }     /* 腿足 左 */\n\n  .placeholder{\n    position:absolute;\n    top:110px;\n    left:150px;\n    width:250px;\n    height:430px;\n    display:flex;\n    align-items:center;\n    justify-content:center;\n    color:#555;\n    font-size:12px;\n    text-align:center;\n    border:1px dashed #b9ad97;\n    background:rgba(255,255,255,0.12);\n    box-sizing:border-box;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"topbar\">\n    <span class=\"from\">From:</span>\n    <span class=\"logo-circle\"></span>\n    <span class=\"t1\">清华博士的古家具美学</span>\n    <span class=\"xhs\">小红书<small>标记我的生活</small></span>\n    <span class=\"t2\">中国古典家具图文分析⑦</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"rule\"></div>\n\n  <div class=\"title\">\n    <div class=\"main\">玫瑰椅</div>\n    <div class=\"sub\">图文分析</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"tb block-tl\">\n    低于一般椅背，背高度与扶手高度相差无几，为典型玫瑰椅。此椅因其后背较矮，在居室中陈设较灵活，在靠窗台陈设时不致高出窗台沿而阻挡视线。因用材单细轻巧，便于搬动，摆法灵活，所以成为明清富豪家中常设座椅。\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"tb block-ml\">\n    明清家具部件名称，为家具雕花饰件，是卡在两条横枨之间的花饰。多用在字\"矮老\"的位置，实际是装饰化了的矮老。多数是用木材镂雕纹样，也有用嵌玉卡子花等其他材料，常用的有双环卡子花、单环卡子花、枫叶卡子花等。\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"tb block-mr\">\n    明时玫瑰椅多圆腿或方腿，而清式腿面常用剑脊线，即在腿的正面，两旁斜刃有如宝剑剑脊的线脚。《鲁班经》有\"剑脊线\"。\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"label lb-beibei\">椅背</div>\n  <div class=\"label lb-touhua\">透雕花饰</div>\n  <div class=\"label lb-bitou\">鼻头榫</div>\n  <div class=\"label lb-kazi\">卡子花</div>\n  <div class=\"label lb-hengcheng\">横枨</div>\n  <div class=\"label lb-tuizu-r\">腿足</div>\n  <div class=\"label lb-tuizu-l\">腿足</div>\n\n  <div class=\"placeholder\">[线描插图：玫瑰椅立体线稿，居中，四周有指示线连接各部件名称标签]</div>\n\n  <div class=\"block-bottom\">\n    使用雕刻手段装饰家具，最早见于战国。经过两千多年的发展和积累，到明清时期已经非常成熟。明清家具的雕刻手法主要有浮雕、透雕、圆雕等几种，将底子镂空和全部挖掉，使纹样镂空突出，留出图案还要做成立体效果。透雕可两面雕，也可只作一面雕。明式家具小面积的雕、镂、刻、凿手法中，刀法平稳，有力准确，小巧别致。明式家具上下枨多用透雕。桌案家具则广泛使用雕镂装饰方法，喜欢在椅子背板、桌案牙条、挡板等部位采用整块透雕，突出剔透、空灵的装饰效果。至清中期以后，雕饰达到了高潮，有时一件家具竟然通体满雕。\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"botrule\"></div>\n  <div class=\"source\">资料来源：《良工匠意》聂菲、张曦，百花文艺出版社，2016年1月</div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
